# This repo is PUBLIC. Nothing private belongs in it.
#
# Personal working notes live OUTSIDE this directory, in a sibling folder
# that is not a repo. Keeping them out of the tree is the real protection:
# an ignore rule that has to name each file would leak those names the
# moment it is committed.
#
# The rules below are only a backstop for accidents.

private/
*.local.md
*.local.html
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
